            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Hot plate and writhing methods were used in the comparison of the analgesic effect of vinegar-processed fresh tuber corydalis and the traditionally vinegar-processed Rhizoma Corydalis. The result shows that the effect of the former is stronger than that of the latter.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
